      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just feel like everything i touch turns to shit lately. i made such a huge mistake with my family and i can see it in their eyes every time they look at me. it's like i'm just this constant weight they have to carry around. i hate that i'm the reason they're all so stressed and unhappy now.",
