      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is exhausting to feel like you are constantly disappointing the people you care about. The pressure you feel to just stop being a \"problem\" is a huge weight, and it speaks to how much you value their peace. Instead of trying to change who you are, perhaps you could focus on finding ways to meet your own needs while being gentle with your family. Acknowledging your pain and seeking support for yourself is a crucial first step toward finding more internal calm.",
